# Books API Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5163

### Get all books
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Books
Accept: application/json

###

### Get book by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Books/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get non-existent book (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Books/999
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new book
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "isbn": "9780743273565",
  "status": 0
}

###

### Create book with duplicate ISBN (should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Another Book",
  "author": "Another Author",
  "isbn": "9780743273565",
  "status": 0
}

###

### Create book with invalid data (should return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "isbn": "123",
  "status": 0
}

###

### Update a book
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby - Updated Edition",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "isbn": "9780743273565",
  "status": 1
}

###

### Update non-existent book (should return 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Books/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Non-existent Book",
  "author": "Unknown Author",
  "isbn": "9781234567890",
  "status": 0
}

###

### Delete a book
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Books/1

###

### Delete non-existent book (should return 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Books/999

###
